From: Jeremy Schoemaker <jeremy@shoemoney.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 17:54:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20=F0=9F=8E=96=EF=B8=8F=20one=20perk=20pur?=
 =?UTF-8?q?chase=20was=20bricking=20every=20Endless=20run=20forever?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The big one: _reset() applies owned Veteran Perks AFTER constructing the sim
(vest / +war_chest / +tokens), but Replay._new_sim() only mirrored assist,
hard and chapter — so the verification re-sim started UNEQUIPPED. Measured on
seed 0x5EED over 1800 scripted ticks: equipped reaches wave 2 at 1300 pts, the
identical inputs unequipped wipe on wave 1 at 0. verify_score() failed,
_apply_score_verdict took the else branch, and _record_run never ran — the one
path to the Hall of Fame, lifetime stats, the Steam upload and VP income. So
the first perk you bought stopped every later run banking, you could never
earn VP for another, and your honest replay was written verified=false for
validate_replay.gd to call CHEAT DETECTED. Perk tiers now ride along in
to_dict/load_from (defaulting to 0, so old replays still load and verify) and
_new_sim replays the same three mutations. PERK_CHEST_BONUS now has one home.

Also:
- _save_cfg raises a SAVE FAILED banner in both failure branches. It only ever
  push_warning'd (invisible in an export) and ~7 callers drop its Error, so a
  failing disk silently ate settings, rebinds, perk purchases and the hall.
- the every-3rd-wave arena L-drop emits arena_shift_blocked when both laps
  plant nothing, mirroring the supply pod's existing fallthrough. It used to
  emit nothing at all, so the "arena keeps changing" beat died in silence.
- a near-miss board tap now emits deny/"tank" instead of eating the keypress —
  the last silent refusal on INTERACT. main.gd already renders that text.

Goldens: measured, not assumed — zero samples moved. Both sim edits are
events-only (excluded from checksum) and the L-drop restructure preserves
control flow exactly (`planted` accumulates but the loop breaks on >0).

Suite: 804 methods / 17,881 assertions / 0 failures. SMOKE OK. lint_sim OK.
